摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"OOMOL Connector for DeepSeek Harness—discover connected apps and execute Actions through progressive MCP discovery without exposing provider credentials.","id":"gh:1335752695","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-oomol","slug":"oomol-lab/dsh-oomol","topics":["ai-agents","connector","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","mcp","model-context-protocol","oomol","plugin","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"OOMOL Connector for DeepSeek Harness—discover connected apps and execute Actions through progressive"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" MCP discovery without exposing provider credentials."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# OOMOL Connector for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Use OOMOL Connector Actions from DeepSeek Harness through progressive MCP discovery."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`dsh-oomol` supports OOMOL Hosted and self-hosted OpenConnector. One plugin instance connects to one"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" Connector endpoint."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"npm package | 中文文档"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Node.js 22.19 or later within Node.js 22, or Node.js 24+\n- DeepSeek Harness `0.2.0-rc.2` through 0"},{"id":"p7s2","text":".2.1 (0.2.1 starts at `0.2.1-rc.1`, its alphas are not supported)\n- An OOMOL account for OOMOL Hoste"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"d, or a running OpenConnector instance for self-hosted use"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Install the plugin into the Web profile and restart Harness:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The plugin appears on the **Plugins** page as `dsh-oomol`. Open it to configure the Connector key."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## OOMOL Hosted"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The package connects to OOMOL Hosted by default:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Create an OOMOL MCP API key in OOMOL Console, then save it on the plugin page. Harness Credentials s"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"tores the key under `OOMOL_MCP_API_KEY`."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Managed environments can provide it at launch:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Set a team identity when needed:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The Connections button opens the native Harness panel for OOMOL Hosted accounts."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Self-hosted OpenConnector"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Override the endpoint in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The plugin recognizes every non-official endpoint as self-hosted. Local OpenConnector deployments ca"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"n run without authentication. Deployments with runtime authentication use the key stored under `OOMO"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"L_CONNECT_RUNTIME_TOKEN`:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"You can also save the runtime API key on the plugin page. Create persistent runtime keys in the Open"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"Connector Console Access page."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Self-hosted HTTP endpoints are limited to `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, and `[::1]`. Remote deployments "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"d HTTP endpoints are limited to `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, and `[::1]`. Remote deployments use HTTPS:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The Connections button opens the endpoint origin, such as `https://connect.example.com`, where OpenC"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"onnector serves its Console."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Custom API key environment name"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Both modes support an explicit credential reference:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Harness Credentials resolves `apiKeyEnv` first and the launch environment second."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Use Connector Actions"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Start with discovery:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"For operations with external effects, include the target account and proposed arguments in your requ"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"est before execution."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"The plugin mounts DeepSeek Harness's Streamable HTTP MCP client with the selected Connector endpoint"},{"id":"p40s2","text":". Connector Actions remain progressively discoverable, keeping the permanent Harness tool surface sm"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"nnector Actions remain progressively discoverable, keeping the permanent Harness tool surface small."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"OOMOL Hosted stores Provider credentials in OOMOL Connector. Self-hosted deployments store them in O"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"penConnector. Harness stores only the Connector client key selected by `apiKeyEnv`."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"The browser receives the credential reference and status metadata. Connector API keys and Provider c"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"redentials stay in Host-side secret boundaries."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"See Architecture for implementation details."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"| Field | Default | Purpose |"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"| `endpoint` | `https://connector.oomol.com/v1/mcp` | Streamable HTTP MCP endpoint |\n| `apiKeyEnv` |"},{"id":"p46s2","text":" Derived from `endpoint` | Harness credential reference and launch environment name |\n| `teamName` |"},{"id":"p46s3","text":" unset | OOMOL Hosted team identity |\n| `teamNameEnv` | `OOMOL_TEAM_NAME` | OOMOL Hosted team enviro"},{"id":"p46s4","text":"nment name |\n| `serverName` | `oomol` | Harness MCP tool namespace |\n| `toolCallTimeoutMs` | `60000`"},{"id":"p46s5","text":" | Tool call timeout |\n| `failOnStartupError` | `false` | Fail Harness startup when MCP discovery fa"},{"id":"p46s6","text":"ol call timeout |\n| `failOnStartupError` | `false` | Fail Harness startup when MCP discovery fails |"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"Derived credential references:"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"| Endpoint mode | Default reference | Required |"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"| OOMOL Hosted | `OOMOL_MCP_API_KEY` | Yes |\n| Self-hosted | `OOMOL_CONNECT_RUNTIME_TOKEN` | Depends"},{"id":"p49s2","text":" on the OpenConnector deployment |"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"| Symptom | Action |"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"| Plugin missing from the Plugins page | Install it in the `web` profile and restart `dsh web` |\n| O"},{"id":"p52s2","text":"OMOL Hosted shows Not configured | Save an OOMOL MCP API key on the plugin page |\n| Self-hosted retu"},{"id":"p52s3","text":"rns Unauthorized | Save a runtime API key created by that OpenConnector instance |\n| Self-hosted Con"},{"id":"p52s4","text":"sole link returns 404 | Open the Console URL configured by the OpenConnector deployment |\n| Expected"},{"id":"p52s5","text":" app is missing | Open the relevant Connector Console and configure the Provider connection |\n| Conn"},{"id":"p52s6","text":"ections tab does not appear | Open a Session first; the Connections tab lives in that Session's righ"},{"id":"p52s7","text":" does not appear | Open a Session first; the Connections tab lives in that Session's right sidebar |"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"Run local diagnostics:"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"- Store Connector API keys in Harness Credentials or the launch environment.\n- Use HTTPS for remote "},{"id":"p56s2","text":"self-hosted endpoints.\n- Review destructive, externally visible, permission-changing, and broad-shar"},{"id":"p56s3","text":"ing Actions before execution.\n- Treat an ambiguous side-effecting call as an unknown outcome and ins"},{"id":"p56s4","text":"pect the Provider before retrying.\n- Report vulnerabilities through SECURITY.md."},{"id":"p57s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p58s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"Build and install the checkout into a Web profile:"},{"id":"p60s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p61s1","text":"License: MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
